# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal data. Read docs/PRIVACY.md before you change anything here.
#
# The LinkedIn export and the CRM opportunity export identify several thousand
# real people by name, title, employer and profile URL. The generated plan and
# the built page embed that same data. None of it belongs in git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
data/work/
data/out/
data/research/
site/index.html
site/*.html
!site/.gitkeep

# The one exception: synthetic records, safe by construction.
!data/sample/
!data/sample/**

# Anything a run leaves behind
*.xlsx
*.docx
*.pdf
*.zip
send_log.csv
reply_log.csv
sendqueue_*.csv
storm_openers.py.bak

# Ordinary noise
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
*.log
